    {
      "text": "迅捷镰刀与重型巨斧代表速度和力量两种明确战斗路线",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Pick a weapon that best suits your combat style. Use a swift scythe to quickly cut down your enemies or wield a great axe to overwhelm them with power.",
