      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "死亡后把收集的灵魂投入永久升级，让每次爬塔都比上一局更强",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Death is not the end in Hollow Survivors: Prologue. Utilize the souls you gather to purchase permanent upgrades from other Hollows, ensuring that you grow stronger with each run.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2909680/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "每张灵魂卡都会直接改变角色外观，不同构筑组合对应不同造型",
      "dimension": "画风",
      "excerpt": "Each soul-card you select directly influences your character's appearance . Every unique combination creates a distinct look for the player.",
